<http://data.silknow.org/object/06211452-2bf9-3176-b529-5b248ee5afd5/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Description: woven silk and metal thread.\nSatin ground woven with a flat silver metal strip used as a weft thread. The warp is white silk and the main wefts are yellow, light red and brown silk.  Brown lines form a generous lattice with large and small round yellow flowers along its length and a yellow star-like flower where the lines cross. Each segment contains an upright stem with yellow and red roots, leaves and buds and a three-petalled yellow and red flower."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/06211452-2bf9-3176-b529-5b248ee5afd5> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/06211452-2bf9-3176-b529-5b248ee5afd5>
